<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK RESERVES FALL FIM 373 MLN IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK RESERVES FALL FIM 373 MLN IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to August 30 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to August 23:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 34,590	 34,963</p>
<p> Money market intervention     9,988	  7,584</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		6,297	  6,460</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,435	  2,435</p>
<p> Total assets		     61,285	 61,892</p>
<p>In the previous week, to August 23, reserves rose by 560</p>
<p>million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
